### FilmFuse core-api - security controls (rate limits, body cap, headers). Token: see me.http.
# Rate limits (in-memory, single replica): 429 + Retry-After (seconds) + {"message"} when exceeded.
#   every request: 600/min per client address, 120/min per user
#   per user: friend requests 30/h, invites 20/h (links, redeem, POST /groups, group invites),
#             reports 20/h, comments 60/h, POST /sessions 30/h, photo upload URLs 20/h
# Bodies over 64 KB: 413 {"message": "The request body is too large."}
# Every API response: Cache-Control: no-cache, no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Response headers (look for Cache-Control, X-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Invite links: run 21 times within an hour - the 21st is a 429 with Retry-After
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Oversized body: paste more than 64 KB into bio to see the 413
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"bio": "paste-more-than-65536-characters-here"}

### Control / bidi characters in names and free text -> 400 with fieldErrors
# {"message": "Validation failed",
#  "fieldErrors": {"displayName": "Cannot contain control characters or invisible formatting characters"}}
# Same for bio, group name/emoji, rating notes, comment bodies and report details (line feeds are
# allowed in the multi-line ones). U+202E is a right-to-left override.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "Ada\u202Eecalevol"}
